    "detail": "When GOBI_GO_BIN and GOBI_PYTHON_BIN are unset, the runner hardcodes /tmp/gondola-go/go/bin/go and /tmp/rebalancer-env/bin/python. The GitHub workflow installs tools on ubuntu-latest but sets neither variable. The shell wrapper PATH preflight does not affect the executable path selected by the Node runner; hosted execution will fail at tool-go-version unless those task-local paths happen to exist. Overriding Go alone still leaves Python unavailable.",
